# The Boom's Big Day (levels/toybox/boom.txt). Walk onto the Boom; fly the spike pit: up
# over the first pillar, down under the stalactite (stop when the first diaper whistles, it
# lands in front), up over the second pillar along the beans, down under the spiky ceiling,
# stop for the third diaper, hop off onto the ledge. On foot, stop at each of the three
# diapers' whistles. The second Boom over the sewage lake: stop for its first diaper, climb
# between the stalactite and the pillar (stop for the second), stop for the third, hop off at
# the goal.
t=0.3 press Right
t=1.4 press Up
t=2.4 release Up
t=4.6 press Down
t=4.95 release Down
t=5.85 release Right
t=6.3 press Right
t=7.1 press Up
t=7.7 release Up
t=10.3 press Down
t=10.95 release Down
t=11.55 release Right
t=12.0 press Right
t=12.75 tap Space 200ms
t=14.95 release Right
t=15.5 press Right
t=16.32 release Right
t=16.9 press Right
t=17.82 release Right
t=18.4 press Right
t=20.35 release Right
t=20.9 press Right
t=21.5 press Up
t=22.2 release Up
t=22.05 release Right
t=22.6 press Right
t=24.52 release Right
t=25.1 press Right
t=26.1 tap Space 200ms
wait 3
